</b><br>Our best-selling Superfood Creamers are real-food, plant-based alternatives to traditional dairy and sugar-laden coffee creamers. Nutritious coconut cream, a touch of organic coconut sugar, calcium &amp; trace minerals (from calcified sea algae off the coast of Iceland), and virgin coconut oil make the perfect creamer to fuel your cup.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-90_"><a title="Coffees" data-action="url" href="/collections/coffees" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-91_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/dsc_8165-1-1646922567463.png?v=1646922568" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/dsc_8165-1-1646922567463.png?v=1646922568 1536w" title="Coffees"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-92_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/coffees" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-94_">Coffee</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-95_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-97_"><b>Ethically Sourced + Organic Coffee Beans<br></b>Using top-rated, premium coffee beans, all of our blends start with certified organic Peruvian coffee beans - hand picked, wet-processed, expertly dried and roasted. Our family of “functional coffees” include specific mushrooms and botanicals to give more purpose to your morning cup.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-98_"><a title="Aloha OatMac Superfood Creamers" data-action="url" href="/collections/aloha-oatmac-superfood-creamers" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-99_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/productdescription_darkmushroom_1-1-1646922581676.png?v=1646922582" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/productdescription_darkmushroom_1-1-1646922581676.png?v=1646922582 1536w" title="Aloha OatMac Superfood Creamers"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-100_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/aloha-oatmac-superfood-creamers" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-102_">Oatmac Creamer</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-103_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-105_"><b>Oats + Macadamia Nuts<br></b>Inspired by flavors of Hawaii, this deliciously rich creamer combines gluten-free oats and nutritious macadamia nuts. Options for Unsweetened and Original with Functional Mushrooms, this creamer is shelf-stable and ready-to-go, wherever and whenever you are.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-106_"><a title="Instafuel" data-action="url" href="/collections/instafuel" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-107_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/instafuelpdpimageproductdescription_1-1-1646922603063.png?v=1646922603" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/instafuelpdpimageproductdescription_1-1-1646922603063.png?v=1646922603 1536w" title="Instafuel"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-108_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/instafuel" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-110_">Instafuel</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-111_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-113_"><b>Instant Superfood Lattes</b><br>Never sacrifice your morning cup again! Perfect for camping, red-eye flights, rushing out the door, or anytime you are on the go. This is a delicious and creamy superfood latte in just seconds. Just add hot water!</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-114_"><a title="Aloha OatMac Plant-Based Powdered Milks" data-action="url" href="/collections/aloha-oatmac-plant-based-powdered-milks" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-115_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-4-1646922636996.png?v=1646922637" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-4-1646922636996.png?v=1646922637 1536w" title="Aloha OatMac Plant-Based Powdered Milks"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-116_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/aloha-oatmac-plant-based-powdered-milks" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-118_">Oatmac Plant-Milk</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-119_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-121_"><b>Revolutionary Plant-Based Powdered Milk</b><br>This power-packed milk is made with nutritious gluten-free oats, delicious macadamia nuts, and one of our favorite superfood seeds, Sacha Inchi. OatMac boasts 10% DV of vitamin D from Agaricus mushroom and 10% DV of Calcium from Aquamin (calcium and trace minerals from calcified sea algae).</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-122_"><a title="Renew Blends" data-action="url" href="/collections/renew-blends" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-123_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-5-1646922652756.png?v=1646922653" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-5-1646922652756.png?v=1646922653 1536w" title="Renew Blends"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-124_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/renew-blends" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-126_">Renew Blends</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-127_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-129_"><b>Protein Blends &amp; Relaxation/Sleep Support
</b><br>The Renew family of products is expertly designed with superfoods from Sacha Inchi and Pumpkin Seed Protein, to Acero la Cherry (a source of vitamin C), and restful botanicals like Chamomile, Hops and Reishi Mushroom. You’ll find the Baobab fruit included as well, a fruit native to Africa and from the majestic, prehistoric Baobab tree sometimes referred to as “the tree of life.”†</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-130_"><a title="Functional Mushroom Blends" data-action="url" href="/collections/functional-mushroom-blends" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-131_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/mushbotspdpwellnessglam1_2000x-1-1646922666981.png?v=1646922668" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/mushbotspdpwellnessglam1_2000x-1-1646922666981.png?v=1646922668 1536w" title="Functional Mushroom Blends"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-132_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/functional-mushroom-blends" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-134_">Functional<br>Mushroom Blends</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-135_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-137_"><b>Formulated With A Purpose</b><br>Functional mushroom extracts and adaptogenic botanicals are expertly formulated to invigorate and support you, the plant-powered way. Our supplement blends,  Stress Less, Wellness, and Energize follow the science and are effective additions to support you.†</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-138_"><a title="Activate Mixes" data-action="url" href="/collections/activate-mixes" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-139_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-7-1646922682420.png?v=1646922682" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-7-1646922682420.png?v=1646922682 1536w" title="Activate Mixes"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-140_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/activate-mixes" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-142_">Activate Mixes</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-143_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-145_"><b>Daily Jumpstart, Prebiotic Greens, Immune Support<br></b>From morning wake-up rituals to greens intake that support the microbiome, to everyday wellness help, these amazing supplements are made from real superfood ingredients like organic lemon, ginger, moringa, acerola cherry, blueberry and shilajit to name a few. Add to hot or cold water or smoothies to support your day.†</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-146_"><a title="Hydrate Coconut Waters" data-action="url" href="/collections/hydration" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-147_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-8-1646922702224.png?v=1646922702" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-8-1646922702224.png?v=1646922702 1536w" title="Hydrate Coconut Waters"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-148_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/hydration" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-150_">Hydrate Coconut Waters</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-151_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-153_"><b>Freeze Dried Coconut + Aquamin™</b><br>Freeze-dried coconut water with naturally occurring electrolytes is delicious and an easy go-to for supporting your hydration needs.  Aquamin™, is a calcium and trace mineral complex derived from calcified marine sea algae harvested from the pristine waters off the coast of Iceland.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-154_"><a title="Homemade Baking Mixes" data-action="url" href="/collections/homemade-baking-mixes" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-155_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-9-1646922718386.png?v=1646922719" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-9-1646922718386.png?v=1646922719 1536w" title="Homemade Baking Mixes"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-156_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/homemade-baking-mixes" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-158_">Baking Mixes</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-159_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-161_"><b>Cookies, Brownies, Pancakes + Waffles</b><br>We just changed baking for the better! Our Homemade Baking Mixes are delicious and fully plant-powered, with superfood ingredients like cassava, buckwheat, almonds, cinnamon, and more. All of our baking mixes are gluten-free and truly vegan, so no eggs required - ever!</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-162_"><a title="Pili Nuts" data-action="url" href="/collections/pili-nuts" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-163_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-10-1646922732451.png?v=1646922732" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-10-1646922732451.png?v=1646922732 1536w" title="Pili Nuts"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-164_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/pili-nuts" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-166_">Harvest Snacks</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-167_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-169_"><b>Pili Nuts</b><br>Better snacking. Better you. Wild harvested Pili Nuts sprouted in purified mountain water and slowly dried come in three superfood flavors. Pilis are a good source of magnesium, an excellent source of Vitamin E, and boast quality fats.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-170_"><a title="Picky Products" data-action="url" href="/collections/picky-all" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fHeRUh gICMby pf-171_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-11-1646922749686.png?v=1646922750" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/originalcreamerpdpimageflavorprofile-11-1646922749686.png?v=1646922750 1536w" title="Picky Products"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ctqQKy ioCblW pf-172_ pgpHeadline"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/picky-all" target="_self"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-174_">Picky Bars Products</span></a></h2><p class="sc-fmBCVi laenLa pf-175_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jtXEFf kGfXVs pf-177_"><b>Real food. Built to fuel.</b><br>A real food energy bar formulated by three professional athletes. Balanced for sport but delicious enough for everyday snacking! Easy, feel good ingredients carefully mixed in a macronutrient harmony that can support big workouts, without the chemicals or cheap fillers found in lots of sport specific products.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6735" data-pf-type="Section" id="hpInThePress" class="sc-bQtKYq fbyRgD pf-178_"><div style="--cw:1250px" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs"><div class="sc-hiCibw hHrFfF pf-179_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hAcGzb bAQARH pf-180_"><div data-pf-type="Custom.HTML" class="sc-dFtzxp VWXPf pf-181_"><script type="text/javascript">
